the name as a text dependency. Formals live on Dynamic alone, so a definition holding a TypeElement cannot read them.
The recommendation counted 4 bounded header formals and 10 methods with formals; the suite now measures the whole:
36 formals in 33 lists (23 headers, 10 methods), 7 of them bounded.

